<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from June 5 to June 11,1997:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 61.00</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 64.97</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 66.80</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 70.15</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$167.26</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$125.45</p>
<p>Unsweetened or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 90.97</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 23.21</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.32</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 25.65</p>
</text>
